---
import '@fontsource/source-sans-3/400.css';
import '@fontsource/source-sans-3/600.css';
import '@fontsource/source-sans-3/700.css';
import '../styles/custom.css';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <title>没有找到页面 - 枫百科</title>
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <link rel="icon" href="/favicon.svg" />
    <style>
      main {
        margin: 0 auto;
        max-width: 52rem;
        padding: 12vh 1.25rem 4rem;
      }

      .not-found-title {
        color: var(--leaf-heading);
        font-size: 2.2rem;
        font-weight: 700;
        letter-spacing: 0;
        margin: 0 0 0.75rem;
      }

      .not-found-copy {
        color: var(--leaf-text);
        font-size: 1.08rem;
        margin: 0 0 1.5rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <p class="leaf-badge">404</p>
      <h1 class="not-found-title">没有找到页面</h1>
      <p class="not-found-copy">这个攻略页还没有收录，或者已经移动到了新的目录。</p>

      <div class="leaf-compact-grid">
        <a class="leaf-compact-card" href="/">
          <strong>返回首页</strong>
          <p>回到 wiki 入口，重新选择游戏或主题。</p>
        </a>
        <a class="leaf-compact-card" href="/games/stardew-valley/">
          <strong>进入星露谷物语</strong>
          <p>查看作物、鱼类、村民、地图和攻略工具。</p>
        </a>
        <a class="leaf-compact-card" href="/games/octopath-traveler-0/quests/">
          <strong>任务线总览</strong>
          <p>查看《歧路旅人 0》的主线与伙伴招募任务。</p>
        </a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
